WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.738 --> 00:00:02.571
- [Voiceover] I can tell you

00:00:02.571 --> 00:00:04.804
I've jumped out of airplanes before.

00:00:04.804 --> 00:00:06.912
I've done almost every
sport there is out there

00:00:06.912 --> 00:00:09.774
and done all these thrills.

00:00:09.774 --> 00:00:13.941
I have never felt the same
as I do when I'm dancing.

00:00:17.964 --> 00:00:22.221
I am a breakdancer, and
I go by B-girlsnap1.

00:00:22.221 --> 00:00:25.554
Snap because I'm actually double-jointed,

00:00:26.618 --> 00:00:27.690
and then the one was added because

00:00:27.690 --> 00:00:30.440
I'm the only b-girl up in Alaska.

00:00:33.279 --> 00:00:36.389
I strictly compete against boys.

00:00:36.389 --> 00:00:40.556
It makes you be good, not
for a girl, but as a dancer.

00:00:53.678 --> 00:00:57.428
Professionally, I'm a
UH60 Black Op mechanic.

00:00:59.528 --> 00:01:03.547
I spend 40 hours a week
fixing helicopters,

00:01:03.547 --> 00:01:07.714
inspecting helicopters,
replacing major components.

00:01:10.319 --> 00:01:14.999
Being in the Army has taught
me a lot of self-discipline

00:01:14.999 --> 00:01:16.797
and focus because

00:01:16.797 --> 00:01:20.547
if my body goes kaputs
I can't do my passion.

00:01:25.655 --> 00:01:29.069
The hip-hop scene in
Anchorage is very small.

00:01:29.069 --> 00:01:31.439
We are so far away from the rest of

00:01:31.439 --> 00:01:35.839
the hip-hop scene in the
United States and in the world.

00:01:35.839 --> 00:01:38.069
Being able to accomplish
what our crew members

00:01:38.069 --> 00:01:39.700
have been able to accomplish

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:42.919
sets a good influence for
everybody else that lives here

00:01:42.919 --> 00:01:47.059
that if they just put enough
time and effort and passion

00:01:47.059 --> 00:01:49.820
into their craft they
can actually go somewhere

00:01:49.820 --> 00:01:51.903
and do something with it.

00:01:53.118 --> 00:01:55.330
Doing all these incredible
things with my body

00:01:55.330 --> 00:01:59.130
to the music and battling
these other people

00:01:59.130 --> 00:02:01.429
is a remarkable feeling that

00:02:01.429 --> 00:02:04.596
I just simply can't get anywhere else.

